@host = http://localhost:5113

### GET-2 · list / filter by category
GET {{host}}/api/products?category=Electronics
Accept: application/json

### GET-1 · product by id
GET {{host}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### POST-2 · create product -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Chair", "sku": "CHR-001", "category": "Furniture", "price": 80, "stock": 3 }

### POST-3 · duplicate SKU -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Laptop 2", "sku": "LAP-001", "category": "Electronics", "price": 900, "stock": 1 }

### PUT-1 · replace product -> 204
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Laptop", "sku": "LAP-001", "category": "Electronics", "price": 999, "stock": 10 }

### PUT-4 · update price -> 204 / 422
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 1500 }

### PATCH-5 · adjust stock -> 200 / 409
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/3/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delta": -2 }

### DELETE-1 · delete product -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/2
